From 371bf32079ba9f39aa7eda4401a44b0afc339c82 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 06:56:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Split hero into text + carousel columns

The carousel now sits to the right of the hero copy at 40% width
(60/40 split) instead of running full-width below it, with a portrait
3:4 aspect ratio so it reads as a tall panel rather than a wide strip.
On mobile it stacks below the text at full width, still portrait.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Lnk4T93LH9WLa79FuvsXSG
